@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed LC-03 independent access and rendition state
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

class SharingLink {
 publication / selected-content scope
 state / version / authorization generation
 protected verifier reference
}
class ViewerContext {
 link identity / generation
 bounded lifecycle scope
}
class DownloadConfiguration {
 generated / uploaded / both / neither
 uploaded-language switches / version
}
class GeneratedRendition {
 exact publication / language / renderer
 attempt / actual output state
}
class UploadedVariant {
 actual language / artifact association
 availability / version
}
class PublicationManifest <<Presentation-owned>>
class PrivateArtifact <<Files-owned>>
ViewerContext --> SharingLink : scoped authorization
SharingLink --> PublicationManifest : permitted content resolution
DownloadConfiguration --> GeneratedRendition : configuration filters availability
DownloadConfiguration --> UploadedVariant : independent language filter
GeneratedRendition --> PublicationManifest : exact input revision
GeneratedRendition --> PrivateArtifact : actual output identity
UploadedVariant --> PrivateArtifact : admitted association
note bottom of SharingLink
 Correct password does not verify employer identity.
 Link controls and PDF modes are independent.
end note
note bottom of PrivateArtifact
 Existence alone grants no access.
 Downloaded copies cannot be recalled.
end note
@enduml
